2.Conduct an informal review of a friend's written test case set for a simple login feature (username and password), and write down 3 suggestions or improvements you would make.
Answer :
I reviewed my friend’s test cases for a simple Username and Password Login feature. Here are 3 suggestions I would make:

1.>Add negative test cases
Include cases for an incorrect username, incorrect password, both fields incorrect, and blank username/password fields.
2.>Add boundary and input validation cases
Test minimum and maximum username/password lengths and check how the system handles special characters or spaces.
3.>Make expected results more specific
Instead of writing “Login should fail,” specify the expected behavior, such as “An ‘Invalid username or password’ message should be displayed and the user should remain on the login screen.”




